## 2. Master IP Addressing & Interface Allocation Table

The HQ Campus uses the private `10.10.0.0/16` address space, segmented into `/24` subnets per VLAN, alongside a dedicated `/30` point-to-point transit link to the WAN Edge.

+--------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------+-----------------+----------------------------------------+
| Device Name  | Interface / SVI  | IP Address    | Subnet Mask     | Default Gateway | Assignment / Purpose                   |
+--------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------+-----------------+----------------------------------------+
| HQ-SW1       | Vlan10 (SVI)     | 10.10.10.1    | 255.255.255.0   | N/A             | Gateway for Data Subnet (VLAN 10)      |
| HQ-SW1       | Vlan20 (SVI)     | 10.10.20.1    | 255.255.255.0   | N/A             | Gateway for Voice Subnet (VLAN 20)     |
| HQ-SW1       | Vlan99 (SVI)     | 10.10.99.1    | 255.255.255.0   | N/A             | Gateway for Management Subnet (VLAN 99)|
| HQ-SW1       | Gi0/0            | 10.0.0.2      | 255.255.255.252 | N/A             | Routed Uplink to WAN Router (HQ-R1)    |
| HQ-SW2       | Vlan99 (SVI)     | 10.10.99.2    | 255.255.255.0   | 10.10.99.1      | Access Switch Management Address       |
| HQ-R1        | Gi0/0            | 10.0.0.1      | 255.255.255.252 | N/A             | WAN Edge Gateway Interface             |
| PC1          | eth0             | 10.10.10.10   | 255.255.255.0   | 10.10.10.1      | User PC (VLAN 10 Access)               |
+--------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------+-----------------+----------------------------------------+

